{
    "title": "Solitaire",
    "description": "Solitaire by Mobile Card Games is the best FREE Solitaire card game on Android!\r\nIf you like Windows Solitaire, you're going to love this game!\r\n\r\nSimple, Fast and Easy, nothing else!\r\n\r\nWe kept the spirit of the classic Solitaire card game (also known as Klondike or Patience), and we improved it to give you the best solitary experience! \r\nIntuitive controls and fresh clean graphics make this game the best Solitare of the market. Drag & drop your card, or simply tap on it, playing has never been so easy!\r\nThis make it easy to play for seniors.\r\n\r\nIt has been optimized for all device sizes : from the smallest screen phone to the largest screen tablet.\r\n\r\nSolitaire can be key to a healthy lifestyle.\r\nTrain your brain with Daily Challenges : 3 new challenges every day to become the King of Solitaire!\r\n\r\nNot convinced yet? Just try it, feel the difference and have fun! What have you got to lose? Solitaire is free!\r\n\r\nFeatures:\r\n\u2660 Klondike (Patience) Solitaire Draw 1 card\r\n\u2660 Klondike (Patience) Solitaire Draw 3 cards\r\n\u2660 Portrait and Landscape support\r\n\u2660 Phone and Tablet support\r\n\u2660 Customizable card faces, card backs and backgrounds\r\n\u2660 Daily Challenges\r\n\u2660 Game Statistics\r\n\u2660 Vegas Scoring mode\r\n\u2660 Undo feature\r\n\u2660 Auto Complete feature\r\n\u2660 Intuitive Gameplay\r\n\u2660 Astonishing graphics\r\n\u2660 And it's FREE, forever!\r\n\r\nIf you like classic, realistic and fun single player card games like Spider Solitaire, Pyramid Solitaire, FreeCell Solitaire, then Solitaire is the game for you!",
    "descriptionHTML": "Solitaire by Mobile Card Games is the best FREE Solitaire card game on Android!<br>If you like Windows Solitaire, you&#39;re going to love this game!<br><br>Simple, Fast and Easy, nothing else!<br><br>We kept the spirit of the classic Solitaire card game (also known as Klondike or Patience), and we improved it to give you the best solitary experience! <br>Intuitive controls and fresh clean graphics make this game the best Solitare of the market. Drag &amp; drop your card, or simply tap on it, playing has never been so easy!<br>This make it easy to play for seniors.<br><br>It has been optimized for all device sizes : from the smallest screen phone to the largest screen tablet.<br><br>Solitaire can be key to a healthy lifestyle.<br>Train your brain with Daily Challenges : 3 new challenges every day to become the King of Solitaire!<br><br>Not convinced yet? Just try it, feel the difference and have fun! What have you got to lose? Solitaire is free!<br><br>Features:<br>\u2660 Klondike (Patience) Solitaire Draw 1 card<br>\u2660 Klondike (Patience) Solitaire Draw 3 cards<br>\u2660 Portrait and Landscape support<br>\u2660 Phone and Tablet support<br>\u2660 Customizable card faces, card backs and backgrounds<br>\u2660 Daily Challenges<br>\u2660 Game Statistics<br>\u2660 Vegas Scoring mode<br>\u2660 Undo feature<br>\u2660 Auto Complete feature<br>\u2660 Intuitive Gameplay<br>\u2660 Astonishing graphics<br>\u2660 And it&#39;s FREE, forever!<br><br>If you like classic, realistic and fun single player card games like Spider Solitaire, Pyramid Solitaire, FreeCell Solitaire, then Solitaire is the game for you!",
    "summary": "Challenge your brain and sharp your mind with this classic Solitaire card game!",
